.TH GEMINI-INVOKE 1 "2026-10-31" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
gemini-invoke \- run an AI CLI command with zdots trace context
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gemini-invoke
[\fIcommand\fR [\fIargs ...\fR]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B gemini-invoke
loads the zdots shell environment, attempts Knowledge Layer context hydration,
and runs the requested command inside an OpenTelemetry session span. The
default command is
.BR gemini .
The command and its arguments are passed through unchanged.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show command help and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-ctx(1)
